  "description": "Makes your word out of a material inside a full scene (e.g. LEAF made of leaves on a forest floor). Type a word (1. Your Word), pick a font, describe the material (2. prompt) and press Invoke. Raise the ControlNet weight (3.) if the word is hard to read; lower it for a more natural look. Needs the Text Font to Image node, an SD1.5 model and the QRCode Monster v2 ControlNet.",
